WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Construct Now on Discord.

00:05.000 --> 00:09.000
In a game studio's #general, Alex writes: @Construct turn this week's support questions into an FAQ.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Discord opens a thread for the request.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Construct reads #support and replies in the thread with the five questions players ask most, and attaches player-faq.md.

00:15.000 --> 00:17.000
It works in your threads.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.000
In #growth, Maya asks Construct to find 10 creators who covered cozy games this month and put them in a sheet.

00:20.000 --> 00:22.000
Anyone on the team can ask.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Alex replies in the thread: post it in #announcements, but ask me first. Construct asks: Post the player FAQ to #announcements now?

00:26.000 --> 00:31.000
It asks before it posts. The Player FAQ appears in #announcements.

00:31.000 --> 00:39.200
Construct is now on Discord. Try it now on construct.computer.
